  << /ActualText (2025\057\057 \034I feel calmer when there are insects in the air\054 because I know I\031m in an environment suitable for life forms\035 \024 solo\056 Self\055published online exhibition curated by Schrocher Gallery\056 Investigation of borderline psychological states and stupor\054 presented through an iPhone\055LIDAR scan of the gallery space reconstructed as a navigable online environment\056\n\n2024\057\057 \034Own nothing but a body\054 become nothing but a body\035 \024 performance work with choreographer Natia Chikvaidze\073 music composition\054 video installation\054 and light design\056 Generative AI video integrated with shot footage and multilayered editing\073 experimental sound through Ableton VSTs and external effects\056 Filmed at Khidi Club\054 Tbilisi\073 performed live at TKESHI New Media Art \046 Diverse Music Festival\054 Tbilisi\056 Investigates misdiagnosis\054 medical experimentation without consent\054 and learned behaviors of pain\056\n\n2022\057\057 \034Post Digital Dreams\035 \024 group show\056 \034Cryo Chamber Person\035\054 cryopreservation installation\054 with Abou Farman \050The New School\051 and Preston Chaunsumlit\056 Centre of\nContemporary Arts\054 Tbilisi\056)
