3309 0 obj
  << /ActualText (2024 \023 Present\057\057 Capsule \050in development\051 \024 time\055locked digital storage platform\056 Files sealed until a specified future date\054 governed by tiered security protocols\056 The project examines temporal ethics in digital archives\072 deferred communication\054 delayed disclosure\054 self\055confrontation across time\056\n\n2024 \023 Present\057\057 Introducing Sound to Space \024 video series on the friction between place and sound\056 The artist enters distinct sites \024 market\054 restaurant walk\055in fridge\054 church\054 hotel lobby \024 with a sculpturally disguised speaker emitting incongruous sounds\072 laughter\054 bees\054 weeping\054 racing cars\054 boiling water\054 fire\056 Functions as both gallery work and short\055form viral content\056)
     /K [ 13 ]
     /P 3310 0 R
     /Pg 3248 0 R
     /S /Span
     /Type /StructElem
  >>
